 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Indefinite pronouns",
     "texto": [
      "**Ceva** means «something» and **altceva**, «something else». **Nimic** means «nothing»; it usually goes with **nu** before the verb: **Nu vreau nimic** («I don't want anything»). The two negative words express a single negation, which is not how English works with «anything»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Flavours",
     "texto": [
      "**Dulce** is «sweet»; **sărată**, «salty»; **gustoasă**, «tasty». The adjective changes to agree with the food: **strugurii sunt dulci**, **brânza este gustoasă**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
